BROWSER COMPONENTS LOADED AT RUNTIME FROM A CDN

  These are not listed in package.json and will be missed by an SBOM tool
  pointed only at the manifest. They are fetched by the browser at page load.

  @simplewebauthn/browser    10.0.0    MIT
                                       loaded by src/gate.html and src/cockpit.html
  qrcodejs (davidshimjs)     unpinned  MIT
                                       loaded by src/gate.html
  Google Identity Services   n/a       Proprietary — Google Terms of Service
                                       https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client
                                       loaded by src/gate.html and by the OAuth
                                       consent page generated in src/mcp-oauth.ts

  KNOWN ISSUE: these are loaded without Subresource Integrity hashes, and the
  qrcodejs reference is unpinned (floating HEAD via a CDN gh path). Both are
  tracked as security findings and should be pinned and vendored before you rely
  on this in production. See SECURITY.md.

